                <mxCell id="dep_body" value="The logical flow above is the same on both targets. Physical differences:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GPU&lt;/b&gt; — Compose runs vLLM + embedding + reranker on one shared GPU (gpu-mem-util 0.70). K8s gives vLLM the GPU exclusively; embedding + reranker run CPU-only (util 0.90).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Access&lt;/b&gt; — Compose maps host ports (chat-ui :3001, rag-admin :8005, agent :8004, ingestion :8002, qdrant :6333). K8s exposes NodePorts (:30086 / :30085 / :30081 / :30083 / :30333).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;SearXNG&lt;/b&gt; web search is optional, off by default." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#393939;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1314" y="338" width="276" height="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
